In NetHack, there's some code that makes it so that throwing sums of
money at soldiers, sergeants, lieutenants and captains has a chance of
making them peaceful.

However, you can NOT do this to watchmen (even though the game messages
make it seem as if you could.) This could be construed as a bug, but
then it might not be. Either way, it's a bit of a shame, considering
the fact that watchmen appear early in the game, well before you are
strong enough to take them on yourself if you anger them.

The patch that lets one bribe the watch is at
http://www.greyfire.org/~l/bribe.diff . Though the odds of successfully
placating them are still a bit low...



